        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAhaziya inkosi yakoJuda esekubonile lokhu wabaleka, waqonda eBeti‐Hagani. UJehu waxotshana laye, wathi: Mcibeni; basebemciba esenqoleni yakhe emqansweni waseGuri eliseduze leIbileyamu. Wabalekela eMegido, wafela khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku zakhe zamthwala, zamusa eJerusalema, zamngcwaba elibeni lakhe kanye labokhokho bakhe emzini kaDavida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngomnyaka wetshumi lanye wokubusa kukaJehoramu indodana kaAhabi uAhaziya waba yinkosi yakoJuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi uJehu esefikile eJezereli, uJezebeli wezwa ngalokhu okwenzakeleyo. Wacomba amehlo akhe, wacecisa ikhanda lakhe, walunguza ngewindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho uJehu engena esangweni, uJezebeli wathi: Uza ngokuthula yini, wena Zimri, mbulali wenkosi yakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehu wasekhangela ngasewindini, wamemeza wathi: Ngubani ongakimi na? Ngubani? Abathenwa ababili loba abathathu bamlunguza engaphansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi: Mphoseleni phansi. Basebemphosela phansi; elinye igazi lakhe lachaphakela emdulini, lasemabhizeni anyathela phezu kwakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasengena esidla enatha, wathi: Ake limthathe lowesifazana oqalekisiweyo limngcwabe, ngoba uyindodakazi yenkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa kwathi lapho besiyamngcwaba, kabaficanga lutho ngaphandle kokhakhayi lenyawo lezandla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi sebembikele uJehu, wathi: Leli yilizwi leNkosi eyalikhuluma ngenceku yayo uElija waseTishibi isithi: Elizweni laseJezereli izinja zizakudla uJezebeli;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kho 21:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lesidumbu sakhe sizakuba njengomquba osegangeni elizweni laseJezereli ukuze kungabi khona othi: Lo nguJezebeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
